":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Steps to reproduce\n1. Create a Python script containing the lines\n   \n   ``` python\n   import sys\n   sys.stdout.buffer.write(b'hey\\n')\n   ```\n2. Execute aforementioned Python script via Python 3.5 (maybe any Python 3.x will do?). It should merely print `hey` and not run into any problems.\n3. Run `pylint <scriptfile.py>`\n### Current behavior\n\nPylint complains with\n\n```\nE:  2, 0: Class 'buffer' has no 'write' member (no-member)\n```\n### Expected behavior\n\nPylint should not produce any output at all.\n### Workarounds\n- The `buffer` field can be accessed via `getattr(sys.stdout, 'buffer')`.\n- The error can be disabled locally by adding the inline option `# pylint: disable=no-member`.\n### pylint --version output\n\npylint 1.5.6,\nastroid 1.4.6\nPython 3.5.1 (v3.5.1:37a07cee5969, Dec  6 2015, 01:54:25) [MSC v.1900 64 bit (AMD64)]\n","closed_by":{"login":"PCManticore","id":448166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODE2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore","html_url":"https://github.com/PCManticore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"